   This project is an independent reimplementation. Its DESIGN was informed
   by reading the following projects, but no source code was copied:

     - cuckoo-code (GPL-3.0-only)  https://github.com/wangyongpeng90/cuckoo-code
       Design ideas taken: the "operate the page, don't call the API"
       approach, the `cuckoo JS-code-block tool protocol, the
       "
ame(signature) — description" tool catalog format, and the
       2000-4000ms randomized send interval.

     - dsh-deepseek-web-login (reference only, for measured anti-ban facts)
       Only published measurement results were used (e.g. "concurrent
       generation triggers a 1-day mute"; "request volume is the main
       suspect behind account limits"). No code was taken.

   See README.md "致谢与来源" for details.
